            <title>[IGNITE-15590] Add batch cache operations histogram metrics</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15590</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For now, we have histogram metrics that updates by the initiator:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;PutTime�
GetTime
RemoveTime
...
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These metrics updates by single and batch operations: put, putAll, ..�.&lt;br/&gt;
This is incorrect and the following metrics should be implemented:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;PutAllTime�
GetAllTime
RemoveAllTime
...
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
